From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rezoss <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Allow custom card creation past max count

Keep the existing support, Developer Mode, and test gates intact, but
make the final maxCount comparison fall through to the existing allowed
return. This only removes the total saved-card count block and leaves the
daily generation policy untouched.

---
 .../aiagent/data/repository/CustomCardRepositoryImpl.smali      | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/repository/CustomCardRepositoryImpl.smali b/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/repository/CustomCardRepositoryImpl.smali
--- a/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/repository/CustomCardRepositoryImpl.smali
+++ b/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/repository/CustomCardRepositoryImpl.smali
@@ -3599,7 +3599,7 @@
 
     move-result v0
 
-    if-le v0, p0, :cond_2
+    if-le v0, p0, :goto_0
 
     :goto_0
     const/4 p0, 0x1
